{"page":121,"width":2010,"height":2883,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"그림 3-7에 나타났듯이 주어진 데이터의 해시 값에 해당하는 위치가 이미 다른 값으로 채우며 있","words":[{"text":"그림","x":236,"y":173,"width":73,"height":40},{"text":"3-7에","x":328,"y":175,"width":102,"height":40},{"text":"나타났듯이","x":449,"y":176,"width":189,"height":42},{"text":"주어진","x":656,"y":178,"width":115,"height":41},{"text":"데이터의","x":788,"y":179,"width":146,"height":42},{"text":"해시","x":953,"y":179,"width":70,"height":41},{"text":"값에","x":1042,"y":178,"width":72,"height":41},{"text":"해당하는","x":1133,"y":179,"width":152,"height":42},{"text":"위치가","x":1299,"y":182,"width":115,"height":42},{"text":"이미","x":1430,"y":185,"width":70,"height":40},{"text":"다른","x":1520,"y":185,"width":78,"height":39},{"text":"값으로","x":1614,"y":184,"width":117,"height":39},{"text":"채우며","x":1747,"y":186,"width":107,"height":42},{"text":"있","x":1872,"y":196,"width":30,"height":38}]},{"text":"다면 다음으로 비어 있는 위치에 새 데이터를 삽입합니다. 그림 3-7에서 처음에 세 개의 원소를","words":[{"text":"다면","x":237,"y":253,"width":75,"height":40},{"text":"다음으로","x":331,"y":253,"width":156,"height":40},{"text":"비어","x":505,"y":255,"width":71,"height":41},{"text":"있는","x":600,"y":255,"width":75,"height":41},{"text":"위치에","x":691,"y":256,"width":111,"height":42},{"text":"새","x":821,"y":258,"width":35,"height":40},{"text":"데이터를","x":877,"y":257,"width":150,"height":41},{"text":"삽입합니다.","x":1042,"y":256,"width":198,"height":42},{"text":"그림","x":1262,"y":259,"width":72,"height":40},{"text":"3-7에서","x":1355,"y":261,"width":136,"height":41},{"text":"처음에","x":1515,"y":259,"width":112,"height":42},{"text":"세","x":1648,"y":260,"width":35,"height":39},{"text":"개의","x":1707,"y":261,"width":72,"height":40},{"text":"원소를","x":1800,"y":262,"width":103,"height":45}]},{"text":"삼입했더니 해시 테이블의 특정 위치에 서로 인접한 군집 형대로 값이 채워졌습니다. 만약 이 구","words":[{"text":"삼입했더니","x":236,"y":331,"width":189,"height":40},{"text":"해시","x":447,"y":331,"width":72,"height":42},{"text":"테이블의","x":541,"y":333,"width":149,"height":41},{"text":"특정","x":709,"y":334,"width":72,"height":40},{"text":"위치에","x":802,"y":334,"width":110,"height":41},{"text":"서로","x":931,"y":334,"width":75,"height":40},{"text":"인접한","x":1024,"y":333,"width":112,"height":41},{"text":"군집","x":1150,"y":335,"width":71,"height":39},{"text":"형대로","x":1242,"y":335,"width":112,"height":40},{"text":"값이","x":1370,"y":337,"width":72,"height":39},{"text":"채워졌습니다.","x":1464,"y":334,"width":243,"height":42},{"text":"만약","x":1730,"y":336,"width":77,"height":39},{"text":"이","x":1823,"y":337,"width":30,"height":39},{"text":"구","x":1871,"y":343,"width":33,"height":37}]},{"text":"간에 해시 값을 갖는 새 원소가 들어오면 이 군집은 더욱 커지게 됩니다. 만약 원소 검색을 할 경","words":[{"text":"간에","x":238,"y":409,"width":74,"height":41},{"text":"해시","x":330,"y":409,"width":72,"height":42},{"text":"값을","x":423,"y":410,"width":78,"height":41},{"text":"갖는","x":516,"y":411,"width":78,"height":41},{"text":"새","x":608,"y":412,"width":34,"height":40},{"text":"원소가","x":661,"y":412,"width":115,"height":40},{"text":"들어오면","x":789,"y":411,"width":151,"height":40},{"text":"이","x":958,"y":410,"width":31,"height":40},{"text":"군집은","x":1008,"y":411,"width":116,"height":40},{"text":"더욱","x":1140,"y":411,"width":75,"height":41},{"text":"커지게","x":1230,"y":411,"width":108,"height":41},{"text":"됩니다.","x":1357,"y":411,"width":122,"height":41},{"text":"만약","x":1501,"y":411,"width":78,"height":39},{"text":"원소","x":1595,"y":410,"width":79,"height":39},{"text":"검색을","x":1692,"y":411,"width":115,"height":40},{"text":"할","x":1821,"y":413,"width":38,"height":38},{"text":"경","x":1872,"y":417,"width":28,"height":38}]},{"text":"우, 해시 함수에서 반환한 위치가 큰 군집의 시작 위치를 가리킨다면 클러스터의 맨 마지막 위지","words":[{"text":"우,","x":238,"y":490,"width":48,"height":42},{"text":"해시","x":307,"y":489,"width":72,"height":41},{"text":"함수에서","x":399,"y":489,"width":151,"height":42},{"text":"반환한","x":570,"y":489,"width":116,"height":40},{"text":"위치가","x":700,"y":489,"width":115,"height":41},{"text":"큰","x":828,"y":491,"width":39,"height":36},{"text":"군집의","x":881,"y":488,"width":110,"height":40},{"text":"시작","x":1011,"y":488,"width":76,"height":40},{"text":"위치를","x":1103,"y":488,"width":113,"height":41},{"text":"가리킨다면","x":1231,"y":488,"width":188,"height":41},{"text":"클러스터의","x":1435,"y":486,"width":192,"height":42},{"text":"맨","x":1649,"y":487,"width":38,"height":38},{"text":"마지막","x":1704,"y":488,"width":117,"height":39},{"text":"위지","x":1836,"y":489,"width":64,"height":41}]},{"text":"까지 선형 검색을 해야 합니다. 그러므로 검색 속도가 크게 느려질 수 있습니다.","words":[{"text":"까지","x":240,"y":568,"width":72,"height":42},{"text":"선형","x":331,"y":568,"width":71,"height":40},{"text":"검색을","x":423,"y":568,"width":115,"height":40},{"text":"해야","x":551,"y":568,"width":76,"height":41},{"text":"합니다.","x":638,"y":567,"width":123,"height":41},{"text":"그러므로","x":779,"y":566,"width":152,"height":40},{"text":"검색","x":946,"y":565,"width":70,"height":41},{"text":"속도가","x":1031,"y":565,"width":116,"height":41},{"text":"크게","x":1159,"y":566,"width":72,"height":40},{"text":"느려질","x":1248,"y":565,"width":111,"height":41},{"text":"수","x":1374,"y":566,"width":39,"height":40},{"text":"있습니다.","x":1429,"y":564,"width":161,"height":41}]},{"text":"즉, 데이터가 특정 위치에 군집호l{clustenng)되는 경우에 문제가 발생하게 됩니다. 데이터가 군집","words":[{"text":"즉,","x":240,"y":669,"width":48,"height":40},{"text":"데이터가","x":311,"y":665,"width":155,"height":42},{"text":"특정","x":480,"y":666,"width":73,"height":39},{"text":"위치에","x":576,"y":664,"width":108,"height":41},{"text":"군집호l{clustenng)되는","x":703,"y":661,"width":363,"height":42},{"text":"경우에","x":1084,"y":662,"width":108,"height":41},{"text":"문제가","x":1211,"y":662,"width":115,"height":41},{"text":"발생하게","x":1341,"y":660,"width":151,"height":41},{"text":"됩니다.","x":1512,"y":659,"width":126,"height":40},{"text":"데이터가","x":1663,"y":658,"width":157,"height":41},{"text":"군집","x":1833,"y":661,"width":68,"height":39}]},{"text":"화된다는 것은 특정 해시 값이 너무 지주 발생해서 데이터가 몇 개의 그룹으로 뭉치는 형태로 저","words":[{"text":"화된다는","x":240,"y":744,"width":158,"height":42},{"text":"것은","x":414,"y":744,"width":76,"height":41},{"text":"특정","x":504,"y":744,"width":72,"height":40},{"text":"해시","x":596,"y":742,"width":70,"height":42},{"text":"값이","x":686,"y":741,"width":71,"height":41},{"text":"너무","x":778,"y":741,"width":74,"height":41},{"text":"지주","x":866,"y":740,"width":77,"height":42},{"text":"발생해서","x":956,"y":739,"width":147,"height":42},{"text":"데이터가","x":1124,"y":740,"width":152,"height":41},{"text":"몇","x":1291,"y":740,"width":34,"height":40},{"text":"개의","x":1344,"y":739,"width":71,"height":41},{"text":"그룹으로","x":1434,"y":739,"width":157,"height":39},{"text":"뭉치는","x":1605,"y":736,"width":121,"height":40},{"text":"형태로","x":1743,"y":736,"width":113,"height":40},{"text":"저","x":1872,"y":738,"width":29,"height":40}]},{"text":"장된다는 의미입니다. 예를 들어 크기가 100인 해시 테이블이 있는데, 대부분의 기가 3에서 7 사","words":[{"text":"장된다는","x":241,"y":824,"width":157,"height":41},{"text":"의미입니다.","x":413,"y":823,"width":199,"height":41},{"text":"예를","x":633,"y":822,"width":74,"height":41},{"text":"들어","x":719,"y":821,"width":72,"height":41},{"text":"크기가","x":809,"y":819,"width":114,"height":42},{"text":"100인","x":938,"y":818,"width":100,"height":40},{"text":"해시","x":1055,"y":819,"width":70,"height":41},{"text":"테이블이","x":1146,"y":819,"width":146,"height":41},{"text":"있는데,","x":1313,"y":817,"width":121,"height":42},{"text":"대부분의","x":1455,"y":815,"width":151,"height":42},{"text":"기가","x":1627,"y":814,"width":79,"height":42},{"text":"3에서","x":1720,"y":814,"width":96,"height":41},{"text":"7","x":1834,"y":820,"width":21,"height":31},{"text":"사","x":1870,"y":816,"width":36,"height":41}]},{"text":"이의 해시 값으로 변환된다고 생각해보겠습니다. 이 경우 대부쁜의 데이터가 3~7 이후 위치에 자","words":[{"text":"이의","x":243,"y":904,"width":73,"height":40},{"text":"해시","x":334,"y":903,"width":72,"height":41},{"text":"값으로","x":424,"y":903,"width":116,"height":40},{"text":"변환된다고","x":554,"y":900,"width":187,"height":41},{"text":"생각해보겠습니다.","x":754,"y":897,"width":307,"height":44},{"text":"이","x":1082,"y":898,"width":31,"height":40},{"text":"경우","x":1133,"y":898,"width":75,"height":40},{"text":"대부쁜의","x":1222,"y":897,"width":147,"height":41},{"text":"데이터가","x":1387,"y":895,"width":156,"height":41},{"text":"3~7","x":1555,"y":901,"width":79,"height":34},{"text":"이후","x":1651,"y":893,"width":78,"height":41},{"text":"위치에","x":1744,"y":892,"width":110,"height":41},{"text":"자","x":1870,"y":895,"width":36,"height":41}]},{"text":"례대로 저장될 것이고, 이로 인해 검색 속도는 급격하게 느려질 것입니다.","words":[{"text":"례대로","x":244,"y":981,"width":116,"height":41},{"text":"저장될","x":374,"y":981,"width":113,"height":41},{"text":"것이고,","x":503,"y":980,"width":121,"height":42},{"text":"이로","x":643,"y":979,"width":74,"height":41},{"text":"인해","x":732,"y":978,"width":69,"height":41},{"text":"검색","x":819,"y":977,"width":69,"height":41},{"text":"속도는","x":902,"y":977,"width":114,"height":40},{"text":"급격하게","x":1028,"y":976,"width":149,"height":40},{"text":"느려질","x":1193,"y":975,"width":112,"height":41},{"text":"것입니다.","x":1322,"y":974,"width":162,"height":41}]},{"text":"이차함수 탐색","words":[{"text":"이차함수","x":245,"y":1154,"width":161,"height":45},{"text":"탐색","x":421,"y":1155,"width":77,"height":44}]},{"text":"선형 탐색의 가장 큰 문제점은 군집화입니다. 충돌이 발생하면 군집을 차례대로 검사해야 하기 때","words":[{"text":"선형","x":244,"y":1251,"width":73,"height":40},{"text":"탐색의","x":336,"y":1251,"width":111,"height":41},{"text":"가장","x":465,"y":1251,"width":76,"height":40},{"text":"큰","x":552,"y":1254,"width":40,"height":35},{"text":"문제점은","x":602,"y":1249,"width":152,"height":40},{"text":"군집화입니다.","x":763,"y":1246,"width":233,"height":43},{"text":"충돌이","x":1014,"y":1244,"width":110,"height":42},{"text":"발생하면","x":1143,"y":1244,"width":151,"height":41},{"text":"군집을","x":1308,"y":1244,"width":118,"height":39},{"text":"차례대로","x":1438,"y":1245,"width":157,"height":41},{"text":"검사해야","x":1610,"y":1245,"width":158,"height":41},{"text":"하기","x":1781,"y":1245,"width":71,"height":41},{"text":"때","x":1871,"y":1247,"width":32,"height":41}]},{"text":"문입니다. 이를 해결하기 위해 선형 방정식이 아닌 이차 방정식을 시용하여 탐색을 수행